===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|enm|ang|pæþ}}, from {{inh|enm|gmw-pro|*paþ}}, from {{inh|enm|gem-pro|*paþaz}}, from an {{der|enm|ira}} language, from {{der|enm|ira-pro|*pántaHh}}, from {{der|enm|iir-pro|*pántaHs}}.

The spellings {{m|enm|paath}} and {{m|enm|pathe}} and {{cog|sco|paith}} prove that a pronunciation of this word with {{IPAchar|/aː/}} existed; it presumably originated from {{w|open-syllable lengthening}} in inflected forms.

